B.aDi=s(["Tres aplicaciones y veinte juegos: T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards y T-G-Apps Boneyard.","Trois applications et vingt jeux : T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards et T-G-Apps Boneyard.","Drei Apps und zwanzig Spiele: T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards und T-G-Apps Boneyard.","Tr\xeas aplicativos e vinte jogos: T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards e T-G-Apps Boneyard.","3\u3064\u306e\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u306820\u306e\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\uff1aT-G-Apps Casino\u3001T-G-Apps House of Cards\u3001T-G-Apps Boneyard\u3002","\u0924\u0940\u0928 \u0910\u092a \u0914\u0930 \u092c\u0940\u0938 \u0917\u0947\u092e: T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards \u0914\u0930 T-G-Apps Boneyard\u0964","Tiga aplikasi dan dua puluh permainan: T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards, dan T-G-Apps Boneyard.","Ba \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng v\xe0 hai m\u01b0\u01a1i tr\xf2 ch\u01a1i: T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards v\xe0 T-G-Apps Boneyard."],t.s)
