B.ayL=s(["Explora T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards y T-G-Apps Boneyard. Juegos de dados, Rummy, Domin\xf3 y Mahjong abren men\xfas de juegos relacionados.","D\xe9couvrez T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards et T-G-Apps Boneyard. Jeux de d\xe9s, Rami, Dominos et Mahjong ouvrent des menus de jeux apparent\xe9s.","Entdecke T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards und T-G-Apps Boneyard. W\xfcrfelspiele, Romm\xe9, Domino und Mahjong \xf6ffnen Men\xfcs mit verwandten Spielen.","Explore T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards e T-G-Apps Boneyard. Jogos de dados, Rummy, Domin\xf3 e Mahjong abrem menus de jogos relacionados.","T-G-Apps Casino\u3001T-G-Apps House of Cards\u3001T-G-Apps Boneyard\u3092\u3054\u89a7\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\u30c0\u30a4\u30b9\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3001\u30e9\u30df\u30fc\u3001\u30c9\u30df\u30ce\u3001\u9ebb\u96c0\u306f\u95a2\u9023\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u306e\u30e1\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u3092\u958b\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002","T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards \u0914\u0930 T-G-Apps Boneyard \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0947\u0902\u0964 \u092a\u093e\u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0916\u0947\u0932, \u0930\u092e\u0940, \u0921\u094b\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b\u091c\u093c \u0914\u0930 \u092e\u093e\u0939\u091c\u094b\u0902\u0917 \u0938\u0902\u092c\u0902\u0927\u093f\u0924 \u0917\u0947\u092e \u0915\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0928\u0942 \u0916\u094b\u0932\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964","Jelajahi T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards, dan T-G-Apps Boneyard. Permainan Dadu, Remi, Domino, dan Mahjong membuka menu berisi permainan terkait.","Kh\xe1m ph\xe1 T-G-Apps Casino, T-G-Apps House of Cards v\xe0 T-G-Apps Boneyard. Tr\xf2 ch\u01a1i x\xfac x\u1eafc, Rummy, Domino v\xe0 M\u1ea1t ch\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1edf ra menu c\xe1c tr\xf2 ch\u01a1i li\xean quan."],t.s)
